* K6 Build & Deployment Decision Tree
** Where to build?
*** On workstation
**** Reason: Pi too slow for Rust compilation
**** Tool: Docker cross-compiler
** Target?
*** arm-unknown-linux-musleabihf
**** CPU: arm1176jzf-s
**** musl: Static linking, smaller binaries
** Runtime?
*** Alpine 3.21 (multi-arch)
**** Why: Minimal footprint (~5MB)
**** Why: Pinned SHA for reproducible builds
** Deploy?
*** Manual via deploy_laser.sh
**** Check: Raspberry Pi Zero W Rev 1.1
**** Check: Service idle + Simulator mode
**** Check: No active attempt/outcome/review
**** Check: Image ID matches

@endmindmap
